  "title": "Everyone uploading PDFs to Claude is wasting their tokens! Do this instead.",
  "description": "Every PDF you upload to Claude burns tokens on formatting junk, broken tables, and images. Microsoft's free open-source tool MarkItDown converts any file (PDF, Word, Excel, PowerPoint, even YouTube links) into clean Markdown that models read natively, cutting token usage and giving you better answers. It even ships with an MCP server for Claude Desktop. Here's the full setup. #Shorts #Claude #AItools\n\nGet the setup guide here: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1dCNzn80Hh_SbNvoJv1MYXyZQyyxdbM4pcTgpJz9bfIg/edit?usp=sharing",
